00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.160
I've had like the worst
photos of me taken like,

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:29.460
in a bathing suit, like going
down on like a big hot dog.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:32.700
Like I've had the worst photos,
like, like a wave coming up.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.900
And I'm not like Heidi Klum.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.853
It's just like, and it's like, you know

00:07:35.853 --> 00:07:39.090
it's so comedic that I just
lean in and don't care.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.880
- I feel like most of my life
is avoiding becoming a meme.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.883
- I am 100. I don't care.

00:07:43.883 --> 00:07:44.716
(Both laugh)

00:07:44.716 --> 00:07:46.091
- Like, meme it up.

00:07:46.091 --> 00:07:47.400
I'm like, I don't care.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.489
I'm gonna live my life.
I'm gonna have the hot dog.

00:07:49.489 --> 00:07:50.322
(laughter)

00:07:50.322 --> 00:07:51.870
Did LeBron ever notice
you taking pictures?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.400
Cause you're really recognizable?

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:57.000
- No. So one time I went to a game and he,

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.010
I was sitting with next to
two people I didn't know,

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.150
and he came down and he waved,

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.800
and I assumed like clearly

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.300
that he's waving at somebody else.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.860
Like why would he be waving at me?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.720
And then I looked at
the two guys to see like

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.340
who LeBron's friends
were and they were like,

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.173
we don't know him.

00:08:09.173 --> 00:08:12.900
And I was like, I think
LeBron was waving at me.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.600
Maybe he's a big, The Mindy Project fan.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:16.500
We never knew.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:17.333
- Wait.

00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:18.270
- [Mindy] Yeah. So he
gave me a little wave

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:19.440
- And you didn't wave back?

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.310
- No, because I didn't know it was me.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.260
So now he probably thinks I'm unfriendly.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:23.550
- He thinks you're a snob

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:25.770
- Because I big timed him.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.140
So now he'll know, cause
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:29.310
We're gonna get this message out.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.420
- I just, you know.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.460
- She would've waved
LeBron. She would've waved.

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.293
- [Mindy] I would've waved back.

00:08:33.293 --> 00:08:34.680
I didn't wanna be, you
know, the worst feeling

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.360
is when someone waves
and you're like, hey.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.650
And they're like, we don't care about you.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:40.350
It was the person next to you.
I didn't wanna be that guy.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.820
- Yeah. I've been that person a lot too.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.906
Yeah. I feel like I'm a lot
of what you don't wanna be.

00:08:43.906 --> 00:08:45.150
- (laughs) No, no. This is like.

00:08:46.557 --> 00:08:47.390
- You know you should hang out with me.

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.870
You'd feel really good about yourself.

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:49.703
- [Mindy] No, this is like.

00:08:49.703 --> 00:08:51.240
- I will cover the ground
of all the other things

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.263
and I won't care.

00:08:52.263 --> 00:08:55.170
How, how do you think though,
like speaking of that,

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.460
like in the public eye
thinks happening or whatever,

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.990
how do you think that's
affected you being a mom?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:01.200
Because I feel like it, it
changed my perspective on things.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.033
- [Mindy] Yeah.

00:09:02.033 --> 00:09:03.420
- I was already kind of nonchalant about

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.850
a lot of industry things,
but I think it just kind of

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.280
changed my perspective even in
my relationships with people.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.200
Did that, did that change for you?

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:13.110
- Yeah. You know, I think
it's, the thing with my kids is

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.020
that I'm really private
about them, you know?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:16.914
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:16.914 --> 00:09:18.480
- I, it's hard because I
love them so much and I talk

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:21.060
about them so much, but I
don't put them on social media.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:21.893
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:21.893 --> 00:09:22.726
- But I don't judge people who do

00:09:22.726 --> 00:09:24.060
because like every time
they do anything cute

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.170
I wanna put them on there.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:28.092
But I'm also like, they're not
really consenting to it, so.

00:09:28.092 --> 00:09:28.925
[Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:28.925 --> 00:09:30.960
- But in terms of just
like the projects I do,

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.160
I do wanna do shows about young women

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.990
who are not perfect,

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.290
but who like learn to
accept themselves, you know,

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:41.910
and who don't look like the kind of women

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:42.990
we've seen on TV before.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.550
You know, it's, and it doesn't seem

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.220
like that profound or
anything, but it just,

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.260
I didn't have that growing
up and it would be nice

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.790
if it was on TV for my daughter.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.320
- [Kelly] For our kids, yeah.
- And again, I'm forgetting

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.120
about my son who also needs good TV.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:54.953
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:09:54.953 --> 00:09:55.786
- But he, he'll be fine.

00:09:55.786 --> 00:09:56.863
- [Kelly] He's fine.

00:09:56.863 --> 00:09:57.696
(audience laughs)

00:09:57.696 --> 00:09:58.529
- He'll be fine.

00:09:58.529 --> 00:10:00.240
- No, I will say, so Sex
Lives of College Girls

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.340
on HBO and your Netflix
show, Never Have I Ever

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.590
are both young women kind of
finding themselves, right?

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.610
- Yeah.
- So this is a thing

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:06.810
that is super important to you.

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:07.643
- Yeah.
- Cause it's

00:10:07.643 --> 00:10:08.610
a narrative you like.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.370
- Yeah. I mean I think the
thing is, is I wanna make shows

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.630
like first and foremost

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.580
that like make you laugh and entertain.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.413
I feel like life is hard.

00:10:15.413 --> 00:10:16.320
- [Kelly] Well done. Accomplished.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.250
- Thank you.

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.470
I wanna go home and just turn on the TV

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:20.550
and be like entertained.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.040
I don't always need to
see serial murderers

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.570
and like all that kind of stuff.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.150
And I just feel like I wanna
make something that's funny.

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:30.330
If they can be funny and
they look a little different

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.760
than what people are used
to, like even better.

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:33.593
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:10:33.593 --> 00:10:35.340
- I don't wanna like preach
at people and you know

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.260
try to make, you know,
teach people lessons

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.880
and make them feel bad about themselves.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.830
I just want them to see
different perspectives.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.430
So that's what I'm trying to do.

